gbb1(){return"Portfolio Keeper is a personal portfolio tracker and trading journal. It is a digital notebook with charts, not a licensed financial adviser, stockbroker, or crystal ball.\n\nNothing displayed in this app \u2014 no gain/loss figure, no chart, no percentage, no analysis, no witty comparison between your stocks and a watchlist \u2014 should be interpreted as a recommendation to buy, sell, hold, panic-sell at 3 am, or do anything at all with your money."},
